ract</li>\n                <li>Step 3: Instant disbursement to registered bank account</li>\n              </ol>\n              <blockquote>Notice: All terms are protected under the consumer lending law of the State Bank.</blockquote>\n              <p>For more details, <a href="https://lottefinance.vn/terms">read terms and conditions online</a>.</p>\n            ',onLinkPress:e=>c.Toast.info(`Tapped link: ${e}`),testID:"demo-html-viewer"})})]}),(0,r.jsx)(u.CodeBlock,{title:"NativePdfView Usage",code:'import { NativePdfView } from \'@mfe/ui-components/components\';\n\n<NativePdfView\n  ref={pdfRef}\n  base64Data={base64Pdf} // or sourceUrl or filePath\n  fitPolicy="width"\n  displayDirection="vertical"\n  enablePinchZoom={true}\n  showsScrollIndicators={true}\n  onPageChanged={(e) => updatePage(e.nativeEvent.currentPage, e.nativeEvent.totalPages)}\n  onLastPage={() => setCanSign(true)}\n/>'}),(0,r.jsxs)(d.AppCard,{children:[(0,r.jsx)(l.Text,{style:g.detailHeader,children:"PDF Document Viewer (Terms & Conditions)"}),(0,r.jsx)(l.Text,{style:g.helperText,children:"Enterprise document viewer featuring a dark action toolbar (Page indicator, Zoom in/out, Download, Print, Share), structured legal paper sheets with red accent header bar, and pagination scroll."}),(0,r.jsx)(l.View,{style:{marginTop:8},children:(0,r.jsx)(d.PdfViewer,{title:"Credit Card Terms & Conditions",documentTitle:"TERMS AND CONDITIONS FOR INDIVIDUAL CREDIT CARD",effectiveDate:"Effective from 30/01/2026",onDownload:()=>l.Alert.alert("Download","Downloading PDF document..."),onPrint:()=>l.Alert.alert("Print","Sending document to printer..."),onShare:()=>l.Alert.alert("Share","Sharing document..."),testID:"demo-pdf-viewer"})})]})]})},g=l.StyleSheet.create({detailHeader:{fontSize:16,fontWeight:"700",color:"#16181D",marginBottom:4},helperText:{fontSize:13,color:"#6B7280",marginBottom:10},cardSpacing:{marginBottom:16},embeddedPdfWrapper:{height:260,borderRadius:8,overflow:"hidden",backgroundColor:"#E5E7EB",ma